# How the demo was built, kept on disk and out of the clone. None of it has ever
# been in a commit here. This repository starts from a single commit holding the
# tree as it stands, so there is no earlier revision to go looking in either.
# A prospect evaluating the demo has no use for any of it.
specs/
docs/superpowers/
.specify/
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
.agents/
skills-lock.json

# The export invoke load-repository writes for the containers to clone.
.remote/

# macOS and editor droppings. None are here today, one `open .` away tomorrow.
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/

# Python build and coverage artifacts. `uv build` writes dist/, pytest-cov the rest.
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.coverage
coverage.xml
htmlcov/
.tox/
.nox/

# Local overrides of the env file. .env.example is the tracked one and stays.
.env.*
